<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 170-8 IN 50 OVERS V ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 170-8 IN 50 OVERS V ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 170 for eight off their 50 overs in the first one-day international against England at Headingley on Thursday.</p>
